Body:
In my  case stopped at around 151K / 17% when using deepseek-v4-pro and forced a compaction. Some times it seems even earlier. Tried overriding the config in opencode json with the following - but it has no effect:

`
"deepseek": {
      "models": {
        "deepseek-v4-pro": {
          "limit": {
            "context": 1048576,
            "input": 1048576,
            "output": 262144
          }
        }
      }
    }
`

I'm on the latest version of Opencode: 1.18.7
